;; Bridge strategy declaration (STRATEGY_PIPELINE §4 + the :strategy/bridge
;; extension) — PARROT v2: the 2-of-3 consensus vote over
;; CHESTNUT/LYNX/MOOSE at hysteresis mult 1.0, trading SPY equity,
;; signalling through components/bridge.steve-v2. Alpaca supports integer-share
;; shorting for SPY in paper, so Parrot preserves the consensus short posture
;; instead of flatten-only degradation. No
;; :strategy/features/:strategy/inference — the feature/inference stages
;; live Python-side; risk + execution run through the canonical pipeline.
;;
;; NOTE (documented v0 deviation): production sized the equity bots by
;; $50k NOTIONAL per entry; v0 uses a FIXED 50-share quantity instead.
;; Notional sizing needs a pricing input in the execution stage — revisit
;; when the bridge strategies graduate past paper/sim.

{:strategy/id "strategy/steve-v2/parrot/v1"
 :strategy/family :strategy-family/steve-v2
 :strategy/name :strategy-name/parrot
 :strategy/version 1
 :strategy/mode-policy #{:mode/paper :mode/sim :mode/replay}
 :strategy/schedule {:session :session/us-equities-regular}
 :strategy/warmup {:required-bars 1}
 :strategy/instruments ["equity/NASDAQ/SPY"]
 :strategy/bridge {:bot :parrot}
 :strategy/signal {:fn-id :signal/steve-v2-bridge}
 :strategy/risk {:policy-id :risk/steve-v2-default
                 :params {:max-positions 1}}
 :strategy/execution {:policy-id :execution/equity-direction-v1
                      :params {:quantity "50" :allow-short? true}}}
